{"4451000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes of the Museum", "steam_appid": 4451000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dark halls of a once-respected museum now consumed by something unseen. You play as Alicia, a restoration student called in by her professor after a mysterious incident. What begins as a routine visit quickly turns into a descent into fear, manipulation, and psychological collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/91995ee38a0d2335b2bdd70e110c5fbf.poster.avif?t=1780506248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/91995ee38a0d2335b2bdd70e110c5fbf.webm?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/91995ee38a0d2335b2bdd70e110c5fbf.mp4?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a cursed hand, you can absorb souls trapped within corrupted relics. These souls unlock sealed paths, power ancient mechanisms, and allow you to solve ritual-based puzzles hidden throughout the museum. But every soul you carry comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more souls you hold, the faster your sanity drains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/36821a80f2c5b5b9efb6867b6c86c5f0.poster.avif?t=1780506248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/36821a80f2c5b5b9efb6867b6c86c5f0.webm?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/36821a80f2c5b5b9efb6867b6c86c5f0.mp4?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your mind weakens, paranormal events intensify. And when your sanity falls too low, something begins to hunt you. A relentless entity can appear anywhere in the museum — emerging without warning, pursuing you through its corridors, and vanishing just as suddenly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing risk is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/5754800b1ae30de5c6630785f9699d7a.poster.avif?t=1780506248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/5754800b1ae30de5c6630785f9699d7a.webm?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/5754800b1ae30de5c6630785f9699d7a.mp4?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ritual vessels to store souls, seek safe rooms to recover your sanity, decipher ancient clues, and decide how much power you are willing to carry before it turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth buried beneath the museum. Question what is real. And confront the one who orchestrated it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/06535d363f1a11a55bf0dd958d937ad9.poster.avif?t=1780506248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/06535d363f1a11a55bf0dd958d937ad9.webm?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/06535d363f1a11a55bf0dd958d937ad9.mp4?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul-Based Progression</strong><br>Absorb and release souls to unlock doors, activate mechanisms, and strengthen your cursed hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual and Environmental Puzzles</strong><br>Solve puzzles tied to ancient artifacts and soul offerings, requiring observation, logic, and risk management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity-Driven Threat System</strong><br>The lower your sanity, the greater the danger. A dynamic entity can manifest anywhere, forcing you to balance power and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Experience</strong><br>Reality remains intact — but your perception does not. Fear escalates as pressure builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pursuer</strong><br>An unpredictable presence stalks the museum, reacting to your instability and punishing reckless choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused Horror Experience</strong><br>A tightly crafted psychological horror journey lasting approximately 90–120 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dark halls of a once-respected museum now consumed by something unseen. You play as Alicia, a restoration student called in by her professor after a mysterious incident. What begins as a routine visit quickly turns into a descent into fear, manipulation, and psychological collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_