ster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/5754800b1ae30de5c6630785f9699d7a.poster.avif?t=1780506248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/5754800b1ae30de5c6630785f9699d7a.webm?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/5754800b1ae30de5c6630785f9699d7a.mp4?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ritual vessels to store souls, seek safe rooms to recover your sanity, decipher ancient clues, and decide how much power you are willing to carry before it turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth buried beneath the museum. Question what is real. And confront the one who orchestrated it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/06535d363f1a11a55bf0dd958d937ad9.poster.avif?t=1780506248\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/06535d363f1a11a55bf0dd958d937ad9.webm?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/extras/06535d363f1a11a55bf0dd958d937ad9.mp4?t=1780506248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul-Based Progression</strong><br>Absorb and release souls to unlock doors, activate mechanisms, and strengthen your cursed hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual and Environmental Puzzles</strong><br>Solve puzzles tied to ancient artifacts and soul offerings, requiring observation, logic, and risk management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity-Driven Threat System</strong><br>The lower your sanity, the greater the danger. A dynamic entity can manifest anywhere, forcing you to balance power and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Experience</strong><br>Reality remains intact — but your perception does not. Fear escalates as pressure builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pursuer</strong><br>An unpredictable presence stalks the museum, reacting to your instability and punishing reckless choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused Horror Experience</strong><br>A tightly crafted psychological horror journey lasting approximately 90–120 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "&quot;Echoes of the Museum&quot; immerses you in a first-person psychological horror set inside a corrupted museum. You are Alicia, a restoration student drawn into a nightmare where collecting souls opens sealed paths, but slowly erodes your sanity and distorts reality.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/75dc6d910df4d37f4efcaf1955c1b2d0b32fe216/header.jpg?t=1780506248", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/7baa8a6f5f3ac4b1e2bf85f9a0594c4ecbc1236e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780506248", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451000/7baa8a6f5f3ac4b1e2bf85f9a0594c4ecbc1236e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780506248", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><stro